cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "Figure-generation code for: Satellite radar reveals rotational self-stabilization in earthquake-triggered landslides"
abstract: >-
  Code and data to reproduce the InSAR-derived figures of the Büyükçekmece
  landslide study (Istanbul, Turkey) before and after the 2019 Mw 5.7 Silivri
  earthquake, using multi-geometry Sentinel-1 Persistent Scatterer InSAR with
  line-of-sight velocity decomposition and phase-space analysis.
type: software
version: 1.0.0
